Package: amber-webkit
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Andre Bremer <hyperquader@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPS@, amber-gtk4 (>= @GTK_MIN@), libegl1, bubblewrap, xdg-dbus-proxy
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Hyperquader-Coders/amber-webkit
Description: WebKitGTK runtime bundle for the amber suite
 One WebKitGTK build (the GTK 4 API, webkitgtk-6.0) shared by the amber
 applications, built against the amber-gtk4 bundle and installed to
 /usr/lib/amber-webkit. Applications reach it only through their RUNPATH.
 It is deliberately not on the ldconfig path, so installing it cannot
 change what anything else on the system links against.
 .
 It holds the two libraries, the web, network and GPU helper processes,
 the injected bundle and the translations. Media playback, WebAudio,
 WebRTC, gamepads and speech synthesis are not built.
 .
 The sonames are those of the distro's libwebkitgtk-6.0-4, so an
 application built against either set of headers runs on it.
